WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:04.781
"You're no match for me, Mighty Man!" an actor said.

2
00:00:04.782 --> 00:00:06.888
She was reading lines from a script.

3
00:00:06.889 --> 00:00:10.408
"Because I am Red Ant!"

4
00:00:10.409 --> 00:00:13.549
"Nice try," the Mighty Man actor said.

5
00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:17.972
"But you forgot—crime doesn't pay!"

6
00:00:17.973 --> 00:00:21.996
The Mighty Man TV show was looking for a new supervillain.

7
00:00:21.997 --> 00:00:24.823
There was a long line of actors waiting to try out.

8
00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:27.599
Mighty Man was reading lines with each one.

9
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.923
"Thank you, Red Ant," the director said.

10
00:00:29.924 --> 00:00:32.649
"Next supervillain, please!"

11
00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:35.919
An actor in a black cape walked onstage.

12
00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:38.396
He wore something shiny on his belt.

13
00:00:38.397 --> 00:00:41.694
The actor started reading his lines in a shaky voice.

14
00:00:41.695 --> 00:00:44.509
"You're no match for me, Mighty Man.

15
00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:47.594
Because . . . er . . . er . . ."

16
00:00:47.595 --> 00:00:49.481
He wiped sweat from his forehead.

17
00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:54.509
"Because . . . I am Darklight Man."

18
00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:57.304
Mighty Man smirked. "Darklight Man?

19
00:00:57.305 --> 00:01:00.123
What kind of supervillain name is that?"

20
00:01:00.124 --> 00:01:03.374
"It's a great name," the actor said, frowning.

21
00:01:03.375 --> 00:01:08.407
"Because Darklight Man is scary like the dark. And he has this."

22
00:01:08.408 --> 00:01:12.904
He took the shiny object off his belt and pressed a button. Ka-riinngg!

23
00:01:12.905 --> 00:01:15.536
It was a glowing light sword!

24
00:01:15.537 --> 00:01:17.884
"Cool sword," the director said.

25
00:01:17.885 --> 00:01:22.600
"But for the show, we need a supervillain who can act."

26
00:01:22.601 --> 00:01:26.356
"Excuse me?" Darklight Man said.

27
00:01:26.357 --> 00:01:31.113
"Your acting stinks," Mighty Man said. "Bye-bye!" Darklight

28
00:01:31.114 --> 00:01:37.030
Man swung his sword angrily. "Relax,

29
00:01:37.031 --> 00:01:39.981
buddy." Mighty Man stepped back. "It's

30
00:01:39.982 --> 00:01:41.841
just a show." "I

31
00:01:41.842 --> 00:01:45.970
can't be your enemy on TV," Darklight Man said. "So,

32
00:01:45.971 --> 00:01:49.166
I'll become your worst enemy in real life. Soon

33
00:01:49.167 --> 00:01:53.553
everyone in Metro City will know Darklight Man!" He

34
00:01:53.554 --> 00:01:57.912
spun around, slashing things onstage with his sword. Shwing! He

35
00:01:57.913 --> 00:01:59.884
cut a light stand in half. Someone

36
00:01:59.885 --> 00:02:08.104
screamed as it toppled over. Crash! ***

37
00:02:08.105 --> 00:02:11.061
Roxy and her friends were watching TV at Jack's house.

38
00:02:11.062 --> 00:02:16.852
Jack was changing channels.

39
00:02:16.853 --> 00:02:19.858
"Cool! Mighty Man is on!"

40
00:02:19.859 --> 00:02:24.139
"I heard the show is looking for a new supervillain," Mara said.

41
00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:27.237
"Lots of local actors are trying out."

42
00:02:27.238 --> 00:02:31.568
"That means the new villain could be someone we know," Jack said.

43
00:02:31.569 --> 00:02:35.787
Terrell laughed. "I doubt it."

44
00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:38.195
"Me too," Roxy said.

45
00:02:38.196 --> 00:02:41.496
Just then her watch beeped.

46
00:02:41.497 --> 00:02:43.179
"I'll get some more snacks."

47
00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:51.698
Roxy jumped up and hurried into the kitchen.

48
00:02:51.699 --> 00:02:53.804
"What's wrong, Mayor Bloom?"

49
00:02:53.805 --> 00:02:58.123
"Rocket Girl, a dangerous supervillain is threatening Mighty Man!"

50
00:02:58.124 --> 00:03:05.446
Roxy laughed. "Mighty Man is just a TV character. He's not real."

51
00:03:05.447 --> 00:03:09.510
"Well, this guy has a real light sword," the mayor said.

52
00:03:09.511 --> 00:03:13.107
"And he's scaring people with it—especially Mighty Man.

53
00:03:13.108 --> 00:03:15.096
I need you to stop him."

54
00:03:15.097 --> 00:03:17.777
"Okay, Mayor," Roxy said.

55
00:03:17.778 --> 00:03:20.508
"This sounds like an easy problem.

56
00:03:20.509 --> 00:03:24.906
But I'm on my way!"

